  "created": "2026-08-07T10:08:05.72Z",
  "description": "A lightweight, dependency-free validation library for modern .NET. 29 validators available both as static calls (Validator.IsEmail(value)) and as string extension methods (value.IsEmail()): IsEmail, IsDisposableEmail, IsBusinessEmail, IsPhone, IsBangladeshPhone, IsInternationalPhone, IsUrl, IsHttpsUrl, IsDomain, IsPasswordStrong, IsPasswordMedium, IsPasswordWeak, GetPasswordStrength, IsIPv4, IsIPv6, IsMacAddress, IsGuid, IsCreditCard, IsNationalId, IsPassport, IsTaxNumber, IsPdf, IsImage, IsExcel, IsWord, IsJson, IsXml, IsBase64 and IsJwt. Built on the right primitive for each job rather than on regular expressions — Luhn for card numbers, IPAddress.TryParse for addresses, Uri.TryCreate for URLs, Utf8JsonReader for JSON, a hardened XmlReader for XML and Convert.TryFromBase64Chars for Base64 — with no regex anywhere. Every validator is total (never throws, null-safe), fully XML-documented and covered by 1,000+ tests on every target framework. Multi-targets net8.0, net9.0 and net10.0. Trim- and Native AOT-safe, with zero transitive dependencies.",
